B.bsY=new A.k("When undefined (null), unselected items are muted in M2 mode, but not in M3 mode. In M3 mode unselected items default to onSurfaceVariant, which already is a bit muted as a part of its color role definition. In M2 mode, onSurface is the default unselected, and it had another muting mechanism. We can be use it here too, in a slightly modified subtly color expressive version.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
