B.a0U=new A.k("The contrasting on color blending mixes in its own main color, into the contrasting ON color. This is only done when a seed generated color for the color in question is not used.\n\nThis contrast blend level affects onSurface, onSurfaceVariant and onInverseSurface, the outline colors and the on colors for the main container colors.\n\nWhen the main on color blending switch is ON, it also affects on colors for primary, secondary, tertiary and error.\n\nWhen seed generated colors are used, the on color contrast color always gets its correct tonal palette on color, but if a main or its container color is pinned to its input value, the the computed blended on color contrast color version defined here will be used instead.\n",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
